        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Lastly, a scenario that involves both extra variables and GEI ingredients is evaluated on the baseline OOBN of Figure 8. This evaluation leverages the unconstrained OOBN's capacity to embed the GEI computation within the Italian socio-economic context. In this framework, scenario simulations can extend beyond changes in the GEI ingredients to include variations in other social and economic characteristics of the territories.",
            "block_bbox": [
